  "root_cause": "The root cause is a misconfiguration in the health check path for the public-api target group. The health check path was changed to /healthz, but the readiness probe in the Kubernetes deployment is still using /health. This mismatch caused the load balancer to report all targets as unhealthy, leading to the PublicAPIUnavailable alert.",
