  "root_cause": "The insight-worker is experiencing frequent Kafka consumer group rebalances due to the heartbeat interval being too close to the session timeout, causing the broker to expire members and trigger rebalances. The evidence includes the high rebalance count, zero messages processed, and zero partitions assigned, despite the workers reporting themselves healthy.",
  "category": "cascading-failure",
  "action_id": "adjust_hpa"
}

